'@@author Rixte
@startuml
title Parsing reset-plan without changing application data
hide footbox
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false

participant MishMash
participant Parser
participant ResetPlanCommand as Reset

MishMash -> Parser : parseCommand("reset-plan")
activate Parser
Parser -> Parser : split command word and arguments
Parser -> Parser : parseNamedCommand("reset-plan", "")
Parser -> Parser : parseResetPlan("")
Parser -> Parser : require blank arguments
create Reset
Parser -> Reset : new ResetPlanCommand(activeMealPlan)
note right of Reset
  Keeps the shared plan-holder reference.
  The latest plan is read only during execute().
end note
Parser --> MishMash : reset command
deactivate Parser
note over MishMash, Reset
  No recipes, plan, settings, groceries,
  or recorded meals change during parsing.
end note
@enduml
'@@author
